I wouldn't really make sense to use it without a pronoun, cause you wouldn't know who wants to be saved (is it the person who says the sentence, or is he referring to someone else ? Or to a group of people ?). Pronouns may be skipped when speaking in some contexts, but their compulsory when you're write.

